WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Two roots this week.

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.040
One means life.

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:04.770
One means breath.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:08.640
Long ago, people thought those were almost the same thing.

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:11.180
Look for them in words you already know.

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:15.410
Then three endings that turn a word into a describing word.

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:19.800
In the footprint game, say each word out loud before you pick an ending.
